    "gradients": "Per-parameter-group L2 norm before clipping, accumulated over four samples; includes generation and auxiliary gradients and is not Adam update magnitude. Fusion group implementations differ across candidates.",
    "losses": "Matched training computations only, not heldout generation quality or convergence criterion."
  },
